  m_text: "\r\nRFI\r\nInmate Number: \r\nUse this form to request clarification of
    policy, procedure, or status. RFIs do not request property or privileges.\r\n\r\n    
    Housing status / classification\r\n     Commissary eligibility\r\n     Property
    rules\r\n     Phone or visitation procedures\r\n     Law library / legal access\r\n\r\n(Requests
    framed as questions receive clarification only. Requests for items or privileges
    may be denied.)\r\n\r\nMore Information: \r\n"
